# FIPS commit scope (per feedback_fips_commit_scope memory): only
# `2026-07-24-File-IO.md` and its diagrams are the reviewed / merged
# spec artifacts.  Everything else in this directory is work-
# tracking scratch (plans, handoffs, session summaries) — kept
# locally for pickup between sessions but not committed.
#
# If a file below stops being scratch (e.g., ready for review),
# `git add -f <file>` and drop its line from this .gitignore.

implementation-plan.md

# Handoff / plan-scratch pattern — most session-pickup notes and
# design plans get regenerated per session; keep any of these
# shapes untracked.
handoff-*.md
plan-*.md
session-*.md
